its options trading is also very powerful,

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:40.300
and very cost-effective.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.035
I highly recommend clicking the link in the comments

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.803
to check out Interactive Brokers.

